{"t":"DLTR","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"Dollar Tree, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Discount Stores","employees":150000,"hq":"Chesapeake, VA, United States","website":"https://www.dollartree.com","summary_en":"Dollar Tree, Inc. operates retail discount stores under the Dollar Tree and Dollar Tree Canada brands in the United States and Canada. The company offers consumable merchandise comprising everyday consumables, such as household paper and chemicals, food, candy, health, personal care products, and frozen and refrigerated food; variety merchandise consisting of toys, durable housewares, gifts, stationery, party goods, greeting cards, softlines, arts and crafts supplies, and other items; and seasonal goods, including Christmas, Easter, Halloween, and Valentine's Day merchandise. The company was founded in 1986 and is based in Chesapeake, Virginia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Dollar Tree, Inc.는 미국과 캐나다에서 Dollar Tree 및 Dollar Tree Canada 브랜드로 소매 할인 매장을 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 가정용 종이 및 화학제품, 식품, 사탕, 건강식품, 개인 위생용품, 냉동 및 냉장 식품 등 일상 소모품으로 구성된 소비재 상품을 제공합니다. 장난감, 내구성 있는 가정용품, 선물, 문구류, 파티 용품, 축하 카드, 소프트라인, 예술 및 공예 용품, 기타 품목으로 구성된 다양한 상품; 크리스마스, 부활절, 할로윈, 발렌타인 데이 상품을 포함한 계절 상품이 있습니다. 이 회사는 1986년에 설립되었으며 버지니아 주 체서피크에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":137.23,"mcap":25748506624.0,"pe":16.714981,"fpe":17.385057,"peg":1.3306,"ps":1.2830181,"pb":7.51904,"ev_ebitda":12.468,"div":0.0,"beta":0.685,"hi52":148.54,"lo52":85.88},"fin":{"rev":20068700160.0,"rev_g":0.07,"eps_g":1.972,"gross":0.3718,"op":0.062090002,"net":0.08035,"roe":0.46032003,"fcf":1049587520.0,"cash":1058099968.0,"debt":7670799872.0,"de":223.945,"eps":8.21,"feps":7.89356},"own":{"short":0.0648,"inst":1.07996,"insider":0.0015700001},"analyst":{"n":26,"mean":134.96153,"median":137.5,"high":165.0,"low":98.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.51724,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":8,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":3},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":15,"sell